-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
HOW TO EXPLORE
===---OO---===

To explore the possibilities of nethack without appearing on the scoreboard:
 - start the game with "nethack -u wizard -D"
   - press ^W and wish for the anything you want
   - press ^V to teleport
 - start the game with "nethack -X"
   - you start with a wand of wishing
 - press ^X in game to enter discovery mode

